        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guardian of Altai</strong> is an atmospheric adventure inspired by the myths and spirits of ancient Altai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a shaman — the last guardian of balance between worlds. Channel the power of the elements, beat your ritual drum, and fight back the darkness that has covered the land. Your journey will take you deep into the underworld to save what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where every sound and symbol pulses with ancient magic. Free the trapped spirits, defeat the spawn of Erlik, and restore harmony before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/f76e7e8c54dc36831c70f4b87736902d.poster.avif?t=1755882319\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/f76e7e8c54dc36831c70f4b87736902d.webm?t=1755882319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/f76e7e8c54dc36831c70f4b87736902d.mp4?t=1755882319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles with mythical creatures and shamanic magic in action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diegetic interface — nothing on screen but the ritual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yurt… and a purring cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethno-fantasy visual style and atmospheric soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/08f9b7c2e317e9c18e593cf03702e8fa.poster.avif?t=1755882319\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/08f9b7c2e317e9c18e593cf03702e8fa.webm?t=1755882319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/08f9b7c2e317e9c18e593cf03702e8fa.mp4?t=1755882319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconnect with the spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a shaman. Become the <strong>Guardian of Altai</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guardian of Altai</strong> is an atmospheric adventure inspired by the myths and spirits of ancient Altai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a shaman — the last guardian of balance between worlds. Channel the power of the elements, beat your ritual drum, and fight back the darkness that has covered the land. Your journey will take you deep into the underworld to save what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where every sound and symbol pulses with ancient magic. Free the trapped spirits, defeat the spawn of Erlik, and restore harmony before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/f76e7e8c54dc36831c70f4b87736902d.poster.avif?t=1755882319\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/f76e7e8c54dc36831c70f4b87736902d.webm?t=1755882319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/f76e7e8c54dc36831c70f4b87736902d.mp4?t=1755882319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles with mythical creatures and shamanic magic in action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diegetic interface — nothing on screen but the ritual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yurt… and a purring cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethno-fantasy visual style and atmospheric soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/08f9b7c2e317e9c18e593cf03702e8fa.poster.avif?t=1755882319\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/08f9b7c2e317e9c18e593cf03702e8fa.webm?t=1755882319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896760/extras/08f9b7c2e317e9c18e593cf03702e8fa.mp4?t=1755882319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconnect with the spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a shaman. Become the <strong>Guardian of Altai</strong>.</p>",
